## What to deliver

Paint each element up operation by operation until its preview matches the brief —
an industrial, riveted-naval interface in the Thunderhead palette, with cyan
tactical readouts, and a clean nine-slice stretch on the panel, gauge, bezel, and
button. Target each with `--element`, and mark each stretchable element's insets
with `ui set-nine-slice`. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded `actions.json`
is your finished submission.
